<!-- ════════════════ 45 · EXAMPLE · MODEL PICKER ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Example: model picker" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #7c3aed;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">45</span>Example</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Switch it in the <span class="accent">editor</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 28px; gap: 40px; align-content: start;">

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">Pick it where you work</span>
          <div class="ide ide-claude">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">claude &middot; /model</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="pr">&gt;</span> /model
  Haiku    <span class="cmt"># fast, cheap</span>
  Sonnet   <span class="cmt"># default</span>
  Opus     <span class="cmt"># hard problems</span></pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">Cursor's model dropdown, Claude Code <code>/model</code>, Copilot's picker, all do the same.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Rule of thumb</span>
          <ul>
            <li>Rename, boilerplate, regex &rarr; <strong>small</strong></li>
            <li>Most edits and features &rarr; <strong>mid</strong></li>
            <li>Architecture, subtle bugs &rarr; <strong>top</strong></li>
            <li>Feels slow on simple work? <strong>Lower the effort</strong> before you upgrade the model.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Lower the effort first: same model, <strong>fewer reasoning tokens, often the same answer</strong>.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "45" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "56" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
